 on a service.</p>

<p><strong>Usage budget</strong> - Helps you plan how much you want to use =
one or more services.</p>

<p><strong>Reservation budget</strong> - This helps you track the usage of =
your Reserved Instances (RI). Two ways of doing it - Reserved Instance (RI)=
 utilization budgets (This lets you see if your Reserved Instances (RI) are=
 unused or under-utilized), Reserved Instance (RI) coverage budgets (This l=
ets you see how much of your instance usage is covered by a reservation).</=
p>

