<p><strong>Amazon S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval</strong></p>

<p>Amazon S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval (formerly S3 Glacier) is the ideal =
storage class for archiving data that does not require immediate access but=
 needs the flexibility to retrieve large sets of data at no cost, such as b=
ackup or disaster recovery use cases. It is a secure, durable, and extremel=
y low-cost Amazon S3 cloud storage class for data archiving and long-term b=
ackup. It is designed to deliver 99.999999999% durability, and provide comp=
rehensive security and compliance capabilities that can help meet even the =
most stringent regulatory requirements.</p>

